3                            =Total Number of Conductors (N+1)
.254                         =Total Line Length (m)
2                            =NDZ
60                           =NDT  Must Have NDT>>NDZ*FINAL*V0/LEN
30.E-9                       =Final Solution Time
1                            =Print Solution Time Step Index
2                            =Conductor Having Source Voltage (at near end)
2                            =Conductor Having Load Voltage (at far end)
1                            =Output Conductor for Terminal Voltages
1.291                        =Ref Conductor dc Resistance (ohms/m)
14.218E6                     =Ref Conductor Break Frequency (Hz)
1  1.291                     =Conductor I dc Resistance (ohms/m)
1  14.218E6                  =Conductor I Break Frequency (Hz)
2  1.291                     =Conductor I dc Resistance (ohms/m)
2  14.218E6                  =Conductor I Break Frequency (Hz)
